  "about": "West takes A (approach locking 2s) and B (none). Cancelled, B is freed at once and A after 2 seconds. Later its train has entered A when B is released by hand: A stays held. Then, granted again, A is released by hand before the train comes: the mast drops to Stop and B stays held until it too is released.",
